      "content": "The fire in the brazier is dying... just like everything else. I can still hear them. The screams from the valley, the sound of the steel hitting bone... all because I misread the scouts. I was supposed to protect them. I was their shield. Now I'm just a butcher in high-grade plate. Every time I close my eyes, I see their faces. There's no honor left in this camp. There's no honor left in me.",
